OL,3,GNEWSABurnham among attendees at
OL,4,Aceremony marking UK's first national
OL,5,Aday for terror victims
OL,6,
OL,7,FToday is the UK's first national day
OL,8,Ffor those impacted by terrorism,
OL,9,Fincluding survivors and their families,
OL,10,Fwitnesses and the emergency services
OL,12,FDelivering opening remarks, chair of
OL,13,Fthe National Emergencies Trust Gerald
OL,14,FOppenheim thanks various officials for
OL,15,Fattending, including PM Andy Burnham
OL,17,FThe room also observes a two-minute
OL,18,Fsilence, followed by a musical
OL,19,Fperformance on a harp
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
