OL,3,GNEWSABurnham among attendees at
OL,4,Aceremony marking UK's first national
OL,5,Aday for terror victims
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhile taking place in London, the
OL,8,Fceremony will be broadcast live at a
OL,9,Fchurch in Lockerbie - the site of the
OL,10,Fdeadliest terror attack on UK soil,
OL,11,Fwrites our reporter in Scotland
OL,13,FEarlier, a survivor of the 2017
OL,14,FManchester Arena bombing told the BBC
OL,15,Fhe "thought life was over" and that he
OL,16,Ffelt "forgotten about" after a
OL,17,Fnine-month stay in hospital
